{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.2019a.q20.material.recovered", "text": "研究表明，学生在学习科学知识之前头脑中会存在着一些相关概念，其中有些是模糊甚至是错误的，会对学生的学习产生不利影响，研究者将这类概念称为前概念。某初中化学老师在进行纯净物概念教学前，为了解学生的前概念设计了以下测试题，并对学生的答题结果进行了统计。【测试题】 下列是纯净物的是（ ）。 A.人造金刚石 B.洁净矿泉水 C.白酒 D.天然气 【测试结果】", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c9fca02a66178cf7c64d5da5384434a0decdc9aa95d07219a9ca7f2552a49282", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2166, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2342, "next_source_question_number": 23, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c9fca02a66178cf7c64d5da5384434a0decdc9aa95d07219a9ca7f2552a49282"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.2019a.q20"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.s4.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.307.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.huaxue.2019a.q20"], "word_count": 176, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "huaxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c9fca02a66178cf7c64d5da5384434a0decdc9aa95d07219a9ca7f2552a49282", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2166, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2342, "next_source_question_number": 23, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《初中化学》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c9fca02a66178cf7c64d5da5384434a0decdc9aa95d07219a9ca